s":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/upZqdbr7AeOxWxJTvnhCErZryK8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/74191/season/2/episode/3"},{"id":"1407206","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"WUGメンバーが各本面で奮闘する中、ついに真夢にドラマのオファーが。しかも岩崎志保とのW主演で盛り上がるワグナーたち！ そのエキストラ募集を見た音芽や歩たちは…","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-10-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/llGEOtTZV52de6YCuKFHJ7nU1pF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/llGEOtTZV52de6YCuKFHJ7nU1pF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/74191/season/2/episode/4"},{"id":"1407205","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ドラマ撮影も佳境を迎え、真夢と志保の距離感はどんどん縮まっていく。グリーンリーブズではファンクラブ交流イベントとして仙台バスツアーを企画することに。一方I-1のレッスン場では白木の新生I-1club構想が発表され、メンバーに動揺が走る。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-11-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6Uk8ngxwzUISYoQUtpfHAvxn75R.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6Uk8ngxwzUISYoQUtpfHAvxn75R.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/74191/season/2/episode/5"},{"id":"1407204","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"WUG！ FCバスツアー当日。参加してくれたワグナーを楽しませようと、別の仕事で抜けられない実波の分までがんばる6人。ツアーに参加していた歩はふとしたはずみでWUGの着ぐるみの中に入ってしまい、勘違いした真夢に温泉に連れて行かれ……","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-11-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pP3VNTS0mUWoI5chWeRAHCJviT7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pP3VNTS0mUWoI5chWeRAHCJviT7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/74191/season/2/episode/6"},{"id":"1398533","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"いよいよ初の全国ツアーに向けて動き出すWUG！ ソロの仕事も順調で、充実して張り切る7人。一方、I-1では新ユニットの立ち上げを宣言する白木の言葉に、メンバーの間に動揺が走る。そして、WUGに憧れる歩たち3人は、ついにグリーンリーヴズのドアを叩くが…","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-11-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cSSK6ZBfrOyNW0MyN2ijpPHhlX8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cSSK6ZBfrOyNW0MyN2ijpPHhlX8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/74191/season/2/episode/7"},{"id":"1402244","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"どうしてもアルバムに新曲を入れたい丹下は、早坂に曲を頼むように松田に指示をするが、なかなか連絡をもらえないでいた。ツアーのチケットの売れ行きが芳しくないことを知ったWUG！たちは、よりいっそうがんばろうと誓い合うが現実は、想像以上に厳しく…","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-12-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yYq0hSjUQ4zBiV0Sq1qZAbgtE65.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yYq0hSjUQ4zBiV0Sq1qZAbgtE65.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/74191/season/2/episode/8"},{"id":"1405140","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"メンバー個人の仕事が増えてきて、ツアーリハーサルの時間に全員集まることも難しくなってきたWUG！ 歌詞作りも難航し、佳乃はリーダーとしての責任感から頭を悩ませる。仕事先で会った志保からI-1の現状と相談を持ちかけられた真夢は親身になるが、そのせいで約束したリハの時間に遅れてしまい…","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-12-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3vij59ehG0Dj4uxUCmHE1d7CZr7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3vij59ehG0Dj4uxUCmHE1d7CZr7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/74191/season/2/episode/9"},{"id":"1407225","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"早坂の曲につける歌詞がなかなかできず、何度もやり直しを命じられるWUG。アルバム発売の締切も近づくが、あと一歩、何かをつかめずにいた。そんなとき、未夕と夏夜はあるユニットのライブに出かけ、あらためて彼女たちとの親交を深めた。それがきっかけとなって作られた歌詞は、果たして…？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-12-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j06HsTBZyPhsQaYOIueRZhXLoMH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j06HsTBZyPhsQaYOIueRZhXLoMH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/74191/season/2/episode/10"},{"id":"1410603","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"WUGの全国ツアーが始まった。しかし、外資で急激に勢力を拡大しつつあるVドル・マキナXにツアーのファイナルを予定していたスタジアムを買収されてしまい、会場が白紙になってしまった。同じ頃、I-1のテコ入れを図る白木からの決定を告げられた志保は、動揺し……！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-12-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b9P4VRhMKWjNz8X6TzJoMDa4CQP.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b9P4VRhMKWjNz8X6TzJoMDa4CQP.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/74191/season/2/episode/11"},{"id":"1417085","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Wake Up, Girls！ツアーファイナル当日。Vドル・マキナXは複数のスタジアムで、I-1はセンターの座を賭けて、そしてWUGの呼びかけで、各地元アイドルたちが『Wake Up, Idols！』を合言葉に、全国同時多発ライブが開催。ファイナルの前座を務めるRun Girls, Run！の緊張をほぐすため、WUGメンバーはある行動に出る…！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-01-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cGV0U6sFskqWj7eRm1hD63Hqppn.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cGV0U6sFskqWj7eRm1hD63Hqppn.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/74191/season/2/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/74191/season/2"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793441436184,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793441436184,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793441436184,"status":"ok","retryCount